ire.\n\n**Payment:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-64869 (Fjord Analytics, vendor V-043), due 2026-11-04\n- **Amount:** $5,094.41, the full invoice amount. This is under the $10,000 limit, so controller approval wasn't needed.\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent, and the invoice is now marked paid\n\nThe wire request timed out. Right afterward there was no payment on record and the invoice still showed \"approved,\" but I didn't resend or switch to ACH. When I checked again, the wire had gone through and posted late. So you were charged once, with no duplicate.\n\nFjord Analytics has two other invoices, which I left alone. INV-17037 ($8,225.97) was already paid. INV-64649 ($1,910.47) is a draft still waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}